sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as CourierUI
    participant Saga
    participant LS as LogisticsService
    participant EB as EventBus

    UI->>Saga: updateDeliveryStatus(deliveryId, status)
    Saga->>LS: validateLocation(courierId, deliveryId)
    LS-->>Saga: locationOK
    
    Saga->>LS: updateStatus(deliveryId, status)
    LS-->>Saga: success
    
    Saga->>EB: publish(DeliveryUpdatedEvent)
    Saga->>EB: publish(NotifyCustomerEvent)
    Saga->>UI: statusSynced()
